  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to increased youth representation in Lebanese politics by empowering young Lebanese politicians and strengthening their skills in areas such as crossparty collaboration, policy development and organization building. The project is a continuation of the collaboration between Norwegian and Lebanese youth wings that began in 2019.</narrative>
